  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/scripting.html#image-smoothing\r\n\r\n> Can be set, to change the preferred quality of image smoothing. Unknown values are ignored.\r\n\r\nThe paragraph above, for imageSmoothingEnabled explicitly mentions the valid values of `true` and `false` (Granted, it's a boolean, but still)\r\nThis description of imageSmoothingQuality should mention that the valid values are \"low\", \"medium\", \"high\".",
